{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】港澳辦主任夏寶龍於香港中文大學深圳分校調研。</p>\n<p>夏寶龍聽取中大深圳分校校長徐揚生介紹，並肯定學校的辦學方向，希望學校繼續發揮獨特優勢，更好服務粵港澳大灣區建設。</p>\n<p>港澳辦分管日常工作的副主任徐啟方、副主任農融、教育局局長蔡若蓮亦有隨行。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:04:12.543893+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:31:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:30.055567+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:57:31.688805+00:00","content_hash":"70c86b0be24eade73a3da880dd8dd864906b41e8850b5b96c520325a1b7ba29c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}